SUMMARY:Robots\, Agents and the Future of Work
LOCATION:Université de Fribourg\, Campus de Pérolles\, PER 21\, Boulevard
  de Pérolles 90
DESCRIPTION:A panel with Peter Fankhauser (co-founder and CEO of ANYbotics)
  and Anne Scherer (co-founder of Delta Labs) on how AI is changing company
  operations\, from autonomous robots on the plant floor to generative AI i
 n the boardroom.\n\nOrganiser: University of Fribourg (CSIS)\n\nDetails an
 d registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/robots-agents-future-of-
 work-fribourg-2026/
